^{:go/end 155} (go/method CounterGranularity "CounterGranularity returns the counter granularity (single counter per\nfunction, or counter per block) selected when building for coverage\nfor the program that produce this meta-data file.\n" ^coverage/CounterGranularity [^{:tag (* CoverageMetaFileReader)} r]
